    <text>
        <body>
            <div>
                <head>Translated parts</head>
                <p xml:id="KR4a0001-start">
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T22:24:01.249+09:00">Of the god-king Gao Yang I am the far offspring,17</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T22:24:49.061+09:00">my late honored sire bore the name of Boyong.18</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T22:48:09.846+09:00">The sheti stars aligned with the year’s first month;19</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T22:50:08.5+09:00">gengyin was the day that I came down.20</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T22:50:32.764+09:00">He scanned and he delved into my first measure,21</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T22:50:38.707+09:00">from the portents my sire bestowed on me fine names:22</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T22:50:51.408+09:00">The name that he gave me was Upright Standard;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T22:50:53.475+09:00">and my formal title was Numinous Poise.23</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:24:55.961+09:00">Hastening went I, as though I could not catch them—29</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:06:04.613+09:00">Such bounty I had of beauty within,26</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:06:14.875+09:00">this was doubled with fair appearance.27</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:06:23.357+09:00">I wore mantles of lovage and remote angelica,28</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:20:52.444+09:00">strung autumn eupatorium to hang from my sash.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:25:02.37+09:00">I feared the years passing would keep me no company.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:25:11.578+09:00">At dawn I would pluck magnolia on bluffs,30</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:25:11.784+09:00">In the twilight on isles I culled star anise blooms.31</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:27:45.627+09:00">Days and months sped past, they did not long linger,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:27:51.608+09:00">springtimes and autumns altered in turn.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:27:57.725+09:00">I thought on things growing, on the fall of their leaves,32</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:28:24.759+09:00">and feared for the Beauty, her drawing toward dark.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:28:34.881+09:00">You do not cling to your prime and forsake what is rotting—33</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:28:49.014+09:00">why not change this measure of yours?34</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:28:55.684+09:00">I will drive my fine steeds, go off at a gallop—</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-1a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:29:26.504+09:00">I will now take the lead, in the vanguard chariot.35</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:30:54.77+09:00">The Three Kings of old were pure and unblemished,36</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:31:01.518+09:00">all things of sweet scent indeed were there.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:31:07.6+09:00">Shen’s pepper was mixed together with cassia,37</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:31:07.848+09:00">while angelica, basil were not strung alone.38</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:31:47.007+09:00">Such shining grandeur had kings Yao and Shun;39</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:31:50.913+09:00">they went the true way, they found the path.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:31:58.74+09:00">Why were kings Jie and Zhow slouching and shambling?—40</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:32:28.659+09:00">they walked at hazard on side-paths.41</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:32:48.228+09:00">Those men of faction had ill-gotten pleasures,44</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:32:52.686+09:00">their paths went in shadow, narrow, unsafe.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:32:57.187+09:00">Not for myself came this dread of doom—</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:33:15.179+09:00">I feared the great chariot soon would be tipped.45</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:33:22.033+09:00">I went swiftly dashing in front and behind,46</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:33:45.166+09:00">till I came to the tracks of our kings before.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:33:53.474+09:00">Lord Calamus did not fathom my nature within,47</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:34:22.436+09:00">he believed instead slander, he glowered in rage.48</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:34:29.402+09:00">I knew well my bluntness had brought me these ills,51</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:34:47.611+09:00">yet I bore through it, I could not forswear.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:34:58.062+09:00">I pointed to Heaven to serve as my warrant,52</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:35:41.377+09:00">it was all because of the Numinous One.53</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:35:49.277+09:00">To me at first firm word had been given,54</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:35:59.512+09:00">she regretted it later, backed off, and was otherwise.55</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:36:05.011+09:00">I made no grievance at separation between us,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-2a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:36:32.282+09:00">but was hurt that the Numinous One so often changed.56</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:36:47.119+09:00">I watered my eupatorium in all their nine tracts,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:36:50.887+09:00">and planted basil in one hundred square rods;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:36:54.927+09:00">I made plots for paeonia and for the wintergreen,57</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:37:11.402+09:00">mixed with wild ginger and sweet angelica.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:37:45.76+09:00">I wished stalks and leaves would stand high and flourish,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:37:50.393+09:00">I looked toward the season when I might reap.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:37:56.376+09:00">If they withered and dried, it would cause me no hurt,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:37:56.866+09:00">I would grieve if such sweetness went rotting in weeds.58</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:38:31.767+09:00">Throngs thrust themselves forward in craving and greed,60</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:38:35.988+09:00">never fully sated in things that they seek.61</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:38:45.812+09:00">They show mercy to self, by this measure others,62</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:38:59.215+09:00">in them the heart stirs to malice and spite.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:39:08.65+09:00">Such a headlong horse-race, each hot in pursuit,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:39:12.9+09:00">is not a thing that thrills my own heart.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:40:08.137+09:00">Old age comes on steadily, soon will be here,63</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:40:13.244+09:00">At dawn I drank dew that dropped from magnolia,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:40:08.645+09:00">I fear my fair name will not be fixed firmly.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:40:38.132+09:00">in twilight ate blooms from chrysanthemums shed.65</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:40:44.998+09:00">If my nature be truly comely, washed utterly pure,66</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:40:59.958+09:00">what hurt can I have in being long wan from hunger?67</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:41:08.754+09:00">I plucked tendrils of trees to knot white angelica,68</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:41:13.249+09:00">pierced fallen pistils of flowering ivy.69</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:41:20.268+09:00">I reached high to cassia for stringing basil,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:41:45.419+09:00">and corded continuous coils of rope-vine.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:41:55.969+09:00">Yes, I took as my rule those fair men of old,70</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:41:59.923+09:00">it was not the garb worn in the ways of our age.71</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:42:04.551+09:00">Though it did not agree with men of these days,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:42:28.007+09:00">I would rest in the pattern that Peng and Xian left.72</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:42:40.825+09:00">Long did I sigh and wipe away tears,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:42:44.746+09:00">sad that men’s lives have so many hardships.73</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:42:48.768+09:00">Though love of the fair was the halter that guided me,74</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:43:08.058+09:00">at dawn I was damned and by twilight, undone.75</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:43:32.235+09:00">Yes, I was undone for a sash hung with basil,76</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:43:36.321+09:00">I lengthened it further by picking angelica.77</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:43:50.642+09:00">Still my heart finds goodness in these—</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:43:51.735+09:00">though I die many times, I will never regret.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:44:19.841+09:00">I reproach the Numinous One’s unbridled wildness,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:44:24.733+09:00">never discerning what lies in men’s hearts.78</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:44:30.622+09:00">Women-throngs envied my delicate brows,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-12T23:44:30.975+09:00">scurrilous songs claimed I found lewdness good.79</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:28:46.363+09:00">Of these times the firm folkways: to be artful in guile;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:28:51.229+09:00">facing compass and square, they would alter the bore-hole.80</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:29:00.603+09:00">They forswear the straight line, go chasing the crooked;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:29:01.037+09:00">rivals for false faces, such is their measure.81</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.46" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:29:25.472+09:00">A woe wells within me, in such despair,82</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.47" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:29:29.511+09:00">alone at an impasse in times such as these.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.48" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:29:33.746+09:00">Best to die promptly, to vanish away,83</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.49" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:29:59.485+09:00">for I cannot bear to show myself thus.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.50" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:30:08.179+09:00">The bird of prey does not go in flocks,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.51" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:30:14.436+09:00">so it has been from times long ago.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.52" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:30:22.003+09:00">How can square and circle ever be matched?—</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.53" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:30:40.58+09:00">what man can find peace on a way not his own?84</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.54" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:30:48.558+09:00">Bending one’s heart, quelling one’s will,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.55" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:30:52.827+09:00">abiding faults found, submitting to shame,85</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.56" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:30:57.326+09:00">wearing pure white, death for the right—86</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-3a.57" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:31:17.189+09:00">these indeed were esteemed by sages of old.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:31:24.207+09:00">I regretted judging the course was not well discerned,87</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:31:30.643+09:00">long I stood staring, about to go back.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:31:47.832+09:00">I will turn my coach ’round, retrace my path—</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:31:48.75+09:00">before I stray too far in my going.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:32:51.825+09:00">I let my horses walk through eupatorium meadows,89</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:32:56.229+09:00">sped to pepper-tree hill, there rested the while.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:33:02.156+09:00">I drew close, did not reach him, I met with fault-finding,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:33:35.535+09:00">I withdrew to restore that garb I first wore.90</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:33:44.747+09:00">I fashioned lotus and caltrop to serve as my robe,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:33:48.297+09:00">I gathered the lotus to serve as my skirt.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:33:52.731+09:00">No one knows me, it is all over!—</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:34:47.13+09:00">but truly my nature has scent steadfastly sweet.91</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:35:18.277+09:00">High was my hat, above me it loomed,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:35:26.247+09:00">my pendants were long of shimmering patterns.92</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:35:33.511+09:00">Fragrance and filth were all intermingled,93</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:36:02.079+09:00">my gleaming flesh only suffered no dwindling.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:36:12.02+09:00">All at once I looked back, and I let my eyes roam,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:36:17.945+09:00">I would go off to view the wild lands around.95</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:36:23.826+09:00">Pendants in profusion, I was richly adorned,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:36:42.621+09:00">their sweet fragrance spread, ever more striking.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:37:00.443+09:00">Each man has a thing in which he finds joy:</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:37:06.728+09:00">I alone love the fair, in that I abide.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:37:13.552+09:00">Though my limbs be cut from me, I still will not change,96</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-4a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:37:43.753+09:00">how could my heart be subdued?97</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:37:52.089+09:00">Then came the Sister, tender and enticing,98</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:39:16.841+09:00">she said: “Gun was unyielding, he fled into hiding,100</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:38:56.981+09:00">at last died untimely on moors of Mount Yu.101</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:40:02.61+09:00">“Why such wide culling, such love of the fair,102</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:40:06.95+09:00">in you alone bounty of beautiful raiment?103</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:42:21.729+09:00">They stack stinkweed filling their rooms;104</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:42:34.287+09:00">you alone stand apart and will not wear it.105</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:42:52.506+09:00">“No swaying the throngs person by person;106</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:42:56.809+09:00">‘no one discerns this my nature within’!107</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:43:01.644+09:00">Men now rise together, each favors their own ilk,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:43:07.599+09:00">why do you stand alone and not listen to me?”</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:43:19.239+09:00">I trust sages of old for fair judgment,108</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.15" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:43:25.5+09:00">my heart swelled in rage, it had come now to this.109</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:43:38.504+09:00">I crossed Xiang and Yuan, faring on southward,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:44:14.831+09:00">reached Chonghua, to state him my case:110</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:44:26.322+09:00">“King Qi had Nine Variations and the Nine Songs—111</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:44:30.424+09:00">extreme in wild pleasures, he did as he pleased.112</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:44:35.289+09:00">He was heedless of troubles, made no plans for the morrow,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:44:36.286+09:00">whereby the five sons brought strife to his house.113</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:45:00.042+09:00">“Yi roamed recklessly, he was lavish in hunts,114</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:45:13.196+09:00">he also loved shooting the great foxes.115</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:45:19.842+09:00">Indeed, going cross-current rarely ends well:116</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:45:53.46+09:00">and Han Zhuo was lusting to seize his bride.117</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:46:01.382+09:00">“Guo Ao garbed himself, he opposed violently;118</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:46:08.086+09:00">he followed his wants, he failed to forbear.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:46:23.489+09:00">He lost himself daily in wild pleasures.119</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:46:52.124+09:00">whereby his own head was toppled and fell.</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:47:00.171+09:00">“Xia’s Jie was constant in his erring,120</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:47:07.578+09:00">in pursuit of these he met with his doom.121</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.32" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:47:11.787+09:00">Shang’s Zhow, the Lord Xin, minced men into stew,122</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.33" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:47:13.507+09:00">whereby Yin’s great lineage could not last long.123</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.34" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:47:45.879+09:00">“Yu the Great was stern, respectful and godly;124</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.35" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:47:50.391+09:00">the right way was Zhou’s norm and thus did not stray.125</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.36" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:49:20.107+09:00">They raised men of worth, rewarded the able,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.37" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:49:23.965+09:00">they kept the straight line, they did not veer.“</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.38" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:58:50.465+09:00">Sovereign Heaven is slanted in favor of none;</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.39" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:58:57.251+09:00">it scans a man’s virtues, puts helpers beside him.126</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.40" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:59:09.121+09:00">Only when sage wisdom does deeds that are splendid,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.41" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:59:16.384+09:00">may one then be used in this land down below.127“</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.42" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:59:21.258+09:00">I viewed times before us, looked to times yet to come,</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.43" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:59:27.431+09:00">observed measures of men, and the ends of their plans:128</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.44" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T00:59:30.887+09:00">who found wanting in virtue may be put to use?</seg>
                    <seg corresp="#KR4a0001_tls_001-5a.45" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2025-10-13T01:00:00.215+09:00">who found wanting in good may still be retained?129</seg>
                </p>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
